{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49043","headline":"奉和郎中游仙山四瀑布兼寄李吏部包秘监判官 · 孟翔","name":"奉和郎中游仙山四瀑布兼寄李吏部包秘监判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔人恣探讨，飞流称石门。\n安知郡城侧，别有神泉源。\n疏凿意大禹，勤求闻轩辕。\n悠悠几千岁，翳荟羣木繁。\n奇状出蔽蔓，胜概毕讨论。\n沿崖百丈落，奔注当空翻。\n下如散雨足，上拟屯云根。\n变态凡几处，静神竟朝昏。\n渴贤寄珠玉，受馥寻兰荪。\n萝茑罥紫绶，岩隈驻朱轓。\n方思谢康乐，好事名空存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}